            "content": "Hey guys! I'm Lokin!\n\n>>> [url=https://forms.gle/jBb69RfXwyGAn18p6]Application Form[/url] <<<\n\nBy helping me debug and improve the game, I will give you the full game Steam key directly.\n[list]\n[*] Playtest Period: [b]22th May 2025 -  5th June 2025[/b]\n[*] Eligibility: Anyone can help me dedbug\n[*] Game Mode: Multiplayer(Prefer) or Single Player\n[*] Feedback Platform: Discord\n[/list]\nIf you have [u]already participated in previous playtest[/u], you can skip this form and use the keys you previously obtained.\n\nI need Bug Report and Game Review!\nPlease post the bug or comment in [b]Discord [/b]: https://discord.gg/v4wHPsRJkB\n\nPlaytester should not [b]LEAK [/b]any game content outside my discord server [b]BEFORE [/b]the game is released.\n\n[b]Fill in you email and Discord ID in Google Form and I will send you a Steam key(Start from 22th May 2025).\nI will check if you join my Discord server yet.[/b]\n\n>>> [url=https://forms.gle/jBb69RfXwyGAn18p6]Application Form[/url] <<<\n\nThe keys for playtest cannot be activated after the game is released.\n\nThanks.❤️\n\nIf you haven't already wishlist, wishlist here.\nWishlist: https://store.steampowered.com/app/2802820/School_666/\n\n[previewyoutube=kcI8FhRE9BM;full][/previewyoutube]"
