            "content": "Guys... I need your help\n\nBy helping me debug and improve the game, I will give you the full game Steam key directly.\n[list]\n[*]Date: 30th December 2024 -  6th January 2025\n[*]Eligibility: Anyone\n[*]Feedback Platform: Discord\n[/list]\nThis game takes ~4 hours to complete. You should finish at least half of the game.\nPlease send me as many as possible bug reports and game comments for improving the game.\nYou can post the bug report or comment on my discord channel (under category \"SCHOOL 666\").\n\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/v4wHPsRJkB\n\nPlayers should not announce any game content outside my discord server before the game is released.\nDepending on the date you played some features in the game may not be fully functional.\n\nI hope to receive some bug reports start from Dec 30. (after this date is also welcome)\nFill in you email below and I will send you a Steam key asap(From Dec 30).\n\n[url=https://forms.gle/Du4H8LioeBkFbnJ76]https://forms.gle/Du4H8LioeBkFbnJ76[/url]\n\nThanksssssssssssssssss.\n\n\n[url=https://discord.gg/v4wHPsRJkB]Discord[/url]\n[url=https://twitter.com/LokIn_hk]Twitter[/url]\n[url=https://www.twitch.tv/lokin_l]Twitch[/url]\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/2802820/School_666/]Wishlist[/url]"
