        {
            "title": "(For Influencers) Looking for gameplay footage for School 666 Steam Next Fest!",
            "date": "2024-10-07 11:14:40",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6350729003509090370",
            "content": "(For Influencers) Looking for gameplay footage for School 666 Steam Next Fest!\n\nSteam Next Fest is coming soon, and the \"School 666\" Steam page will broadcast demo gameplay.\nAny influencer is interested in filming a ~5-20 minute demo gameplay video and letting me put it on the Steam page?\nThe influencer need to have at least 5k subscribers or followers on YouTube/Twitch/Bilibili/Tiktok.\nVideo languages need to be English/Mandarin/Japanese.\nYou can promote your video by displaying your name, logo, links, etc.\nThe video should contain a normal play through of the \"School 666\" demo.\nIt can be a single player or multiplayer game.\n\nThe game demo can be downloaded directly from School 666 on Steam.\nDifferent live main videos will be played in a loop.\nSteam Next Fest will be held from October 14th to 21st.\nVideos may be cut to reduce boring scenes.\n\nIf you are interested you can contact me via discord or email.\nEmail: edmundlylee@gmail.com\nDiscord: lokin0929\n\nSolo Game Developer\nLokin"
        },
