            "title": "Free Steam Key for Content Creator (Early Access)",
            "date": "2024-01-30 13:06:25",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5519792046267274110",
            "content": "I apologize for the delay in the release of the game.\nI hope this doesn't affect your schedule too much.\n\nBefore the game is released, I want to send out some free Steam keys.\nIf you're a YouTuber, Streamer, or Reviewer, please fill out the Google form and I'll send you a key before the official launch date. (Around February 28)\nOr if you have any special reasons or inquiries, please feel free to let me know.\n\nhttps://forms.gle/i9fGrFNzkCCQ1byv5\n\nP.S. The full version of the game is quite long. It has single player and multiplayer games (kind of like an escape room)\n\nIt's really fun to watch you all play my games. XD\n\nIf you want to learn more about this game, check out my YouTube channel.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@LokinLeeGaming\nIf you want to talk to me, join my Discord.\ndiscord.gg/v4wHPsRJkB"
